# Item_CollectSmallHealth: no corpus run collects a small health pickup (ruling 5, 2). Its one
# caller is the small pickup's touch coroutine ($13536: sound $12, Op2_CallNativeRel), the same call
# as Item_CollectBigHealth's from the large pickup's ($13436). The cases run at Item_CollectBigHealth's
# first call (TAS f7565, player 1 collecting: g_Player1 +4 health), with the health set below and
# near the cap.

at $013440

case as_called

case near_full
w $FFFFF654 = $F8

case low
w $FFFFF654 = $20
